Subject: [PATCH] input: the Transformers keyboard and mouse layout

WASD move, the mouse looks; left click fires (R1), right click the aiming view (R3, which the
game toggles), middle click jumps (L1); Space jump (L1), T transform (Triangle), Q / E / Z the
L1 / R2 / L2 Mini-Cons, Esc or P pause (Start). X stays Cross (the menus), Enter Start, the
arrows the D-pad; R Square, C Circle, Shift L2, Ctrl R2, G L3, B R3, Alt R1, Tab Select.
Esc still also gives the mouse back to the desktop.

diff --git a/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_pad.cpp b/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_pad.cpp
index a1e7281..5768499 100644
